<title>HONDURAS: Honduras May inflation rate rises 1.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Honduras May inflation rate rises 1.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduras May inflation rate rose 1.2 percent, bringing cumulative inflation to 7.3 percent for the year so far, the central bank of Honduras said on Friday.</p>
<p>In April, the consumer price index rose 0.6 percent.</p>
<p>Cumulative inflation to the end of May 1996 was 9.4 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Honduras bureau +504 327 898))</p>
